turborust.json is turborust's own JSON Schema for turborust.toml, emitted by:

    turborust schema > crates/crabbucket-cli/schema/turborust.json

Vendored, not fetched, so the check runs offline and on a machine that has no
turborust.  It is turborust's definition rather than a restatement of it,
which is the point: crabbucket ships a turborust.toml in every scaffolded
site, and a schema change there should fail crabbucket's build rather than a
user's.

Regenerate it when turborust changes.  A diff in this file is the signal that
the scaffold may need to change too.

  turborust version  0.1.0
  turborust commit   2e5e9d2
  taken              2026-09-08
